2026-10-15T18:44:37 |absolute pathname of the executable. If so, set usegetexecpath in
2026-10-15T18:44:37 |config.sh and USE_GETEXECPATH in config.h. If this is set, then
2026-10-15T18:44:37 |use this approach in S_set_caret_X() to canonicalise $^X as an
